{"kBP":{"title":"反向传播推导","mc":"#15803d","body":"<div class=\"m-meta\"><p class=\"role\">把链式法则按层倒着用，一次反向计算就得到所有参数的梯度。</p><div class=\"where\">📍 所在位置：<a data-go=\"T1\">应用全景</a> › <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> › <a data-go=\"T3\">大模型</a> › <a data-go=\"N\">神经网络入门</a> › <a data-go=\"K5\">数学 · 推导与证明</a> › <b>反向传播推导</b></div><span class=\"status no\">📐 数学基础：不是一个部件，而是部件背后的计算规则</span></div><div class=\"tryit\"><b>🧪 动手试试：</b><button class=\"btn primary\" data-jump=\"labGradCheck\" data-lv=\"K5\">🧪 反向传播 vs 数值梯度（推导与证明）</button></div><div class=\"m-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"卡片分栏\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t0\" aria-controls=\"mt@p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">🎯 作用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t1\" aria-controls=\"mt@p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">▶ 怎么用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t2\" aria-controls=\"mt@p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">🧠 为什么</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t3\" aria-controls=\"mt@p3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">⚠️ 局限</button></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sec\"><h4>🎯 作用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>每层两条公式：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial L/\\partial W=\\delta\\,x^{\\top}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial L/\\partial x=W^{\\top}\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span>。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec\" style=\"background:#f0f9ff\"><h4>▶ 怎么用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>前向时把每层的输入存下来，反向时用。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec why\"><h4>🧠 为什么这么设计（底层逻辑）</h4><p>损失是一个数、参数有很多个：从输出往回算，每个中间结果只算一次。</p></div><div class=\"sec eff\"><h4>✅ 为什么这样做就有效</h4><p>反向每层两次矩阵乘、前向一次，所以一次训练步大约是前向的 3 倍计算量。</p></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p3\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t3\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"lim\">⚠️ 局限/说明：要存前向的中间结果，显存随层数和序列长度增长。</p></div>"},"kSCE":{"title":"softmax + 交叉熵的梯度 p−y","mc":"#15803d","body":"<div class=\"m-meta\"><p class=\"role\">对分数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span> 的梯度就是“预测概率 − 正确答案”：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla_z L=p-y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span>。</p><div class=\"where\">📍 所在位置：<a data-go=\"T1\">应用全景</a> › <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> › <a data-go=\"T3\">大模型</a> › <a data-go=\"N\">神经网络入门</a> › <a data-go=\"K5\">数学 · 推导与证明</a> › <b>softmax + 交叉熵的梯度 p−y</b></div><span class=\"status no\">📐 数学基础：不是一个部件，而是部件背后的计算规则</span></div><div class=\"tryit\"><b>🧪 动手试试：</b><button class=\"btn primary\" data-jump=\"labSoftmax\" data-lv=\"K3\">🧪 softmax 与交叉熵（概率与信息）</button></div><div class=\"m-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"卡片分栏\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t0\" aria-controls=\"mt@p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">🎯 作用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t1\" aria-controls=\"mt@p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">▶ 怎么用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t2\" aria-controls=\"mt@p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">🧠 为什么</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t3\" aria-controls=\"mt@p3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">⚠️ 局限</button></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sec\"><h4>🎯 作用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>正确词元的分数被往上推（p−1<0），其余被往下压（p>0），力度等于它的概率。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec\" style=\"background:#f0f9ff\"><h4>▶ 怎么用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>这就是反向传播在输出层的起点 δ。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec why\"><h4>🧠 为什么这么设计（底层逻辑）</h4><p>softmax 的指数和交叉熵的对数正好抵消，留下最简单的形式。</p></div><div class=\"sec eff\"><h4>✅ 为什么这样做就有效</h4><p>梯度每个分量都在 (−1, 1) 之间，数值稳定。</p></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p3\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t3\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"lim\">⚠️ 局限/说明：前提是 y 的各分量加起来等于 1（独热标签或概率标签）。</p></div>"},"kSqrt":{"title":"注意力的 √dₖ 缩放","mc":"#15803d","body":"<div class=\"m-meta\"><p class=\"role\">打分除以 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{d_k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1828em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8572em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8172em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1828em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，让点积的方差回到 1，softmax 不至于饱和。</p><div class=\"where\">📍 所在位置：<a data-go=\"T1\">应用全景</a> › <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> › <a data-go=\"T3\">大模型</a> › <a data-go=\"N\">神经网络入门</a> › <a data-go=\"K5\">数学 · 推导与证明</a> › <b>注意力的 √dₖ 缩放</b></div><span class=\"status no\">📐 数学基础：不是一个部件，而是部件背后的计算规则</span></div><div class=\"m-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"卡片分栏\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t0\" aria-controls=\"mt@p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">🎯 作用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t1\" aria-controls=\"mt@p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">▶ 怎么用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t2\" aria-controls=\"mt@p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">🧠 为什么</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t3\" aria-controls=\"mt@p3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">⚠️ 局限</button></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sec\"><h4>🎯 作用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>若 q、k 各分量独立、均值 0、方差 1，则 q·k 的方差为 dₖ（Transformer 原论文脚注里的论证）。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec\" style=\"background:#f0f9ff\"><h4>▶ 怎么用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>dₖ=64 时标准差是 8，除以 √64=8 后回到 1。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec why\"><h4>🧠 为什么这么设计（底层逻辑）</h4><p>分数越分散，softmax 越接近独热，梯度 p(1−p) 越接近 0。</p></div><div class=\"sec eff\"><h4>✅ 为什么这样做就有效</h4><p>缩放后训练初期注意力权重不会一开始就“锁死”在一个位置上。</p></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p3\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t3\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"lim\">⚠️ 局限/说明：“独立、方差 1”是简化假设，用来说明量级，不是精确描述。</p></div>"},"kRes":{"title":"残差连接的梯度","mc":"#15803d","body":"<div class=\"m-meta\"><p class=\"role\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x+F(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 的雅可比是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I+\\partial F/\\partial x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span>，梯度总有一条“直通”的路。</p><div class=\"where\">📍 所在位置：<a data-go=\"T1\">应用全景</a> › <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> › <a data-go=\"T3\">大模型</a> › <a data-go=\"N\">神经网络入门</a> › <a data-go=\"K5\">数学 · 推导与证明</a> › <b>残差连接的梯度</b></div><span class=\"status no\">📐 数学基础：不是一个部件，而是部件背后的计算规则</span></div><div class=\"m-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"卡片分栏\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t0\" aria-controls=\"mt@p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">🎯 作用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t1\" aria-controls=\"mt@p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">▶ 怎么用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t2\" aria-controls=\"mt@p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">🧠 为什么</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t3\" aria-controls=\"mt@p3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">⚠️ 局限</button></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sec\"><h4>🎯 作用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>即使每层 F 的导数很小，梯度也不会在深层网络里乘到消失。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec\" style=\"background:#f0f9ff\"><h4>▶ 怎么用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>Transformer 每个子层都包在残差里：x + 注意力(x)、x + 前馈(x)。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec why\"><h4>🧠 为什么这么设计（底层逻辑）</h4><p>把连乘展开：∏(I+Jₗ) = I + ΣJₗ + …，第一项 I 原样把梯度送回去。</p></div><div class=\"sec eff\"><h4>✅ 为什么这样做就有效</h4><p>ResNet（2015）用它训练了上百层的网络。</p></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p3\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t3\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"lim\">⚠️ 局限/说明：残差解决的是“梯度传不回去”，不保证每层都学到有用的东西。</p></div>"},"kPG":{"title":"策略梯度","mc":"#15803d","body":"<div class=\"m-meta\"><p class=\"role\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi>R</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla_\\theta J=\\mathbb{E}\\big[R\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\log\\pi_\\theta(\\tau)\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span>：奖励高的输出，提高它的概率。</p><div class=\"where\">📍 所在位置：<a data-go=\"T1\">应用全景</a> › <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> › <a data-go=\"T3\">大模型</a> › <a data-go=\"N\">神经网络入门</a> › <a data-go=\"K5\">数学 · 推导与证明</a> › <b>策略梯度</b></div><span class=\"status no\">📐 数学基础：不是一个部件，而是部件背后的计算规则</span></div><div class=\"m-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"卡片分栏\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t0\" aria-controls=\"mt@p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">🎯 作用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t1\" aria-controls=\"mt@p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">▶ 怎么用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t2\" aria-controls=\"mt@p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">🧠 为什么</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t3\" aria-controls=\"mt@p3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">⚠️ 局限</button></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sec\"><h4>🎯 作用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>奖励不可导（比如“答案对不对”），也能得到梯度。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec\" style=\"background:#f0f9ff\"><h4>▶ 怎么用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>采样一些回答 → 打分 → 用 (R − b)·∇log π 更新；b 是基线（如同组平均分）。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec why\"><h4>🧠 为什么这么设计（底层逻辑）</h4><p>关键一步是 ∇π = π·∇log π（对数导数技巧），把“对分布求导”变成“对样本求平均”。</p></div><div class=\"sec eff\"><h4>✅ 为什么这样做就有效</h4><p>减去基线不改变期望（本站证明），但能显著降低方差。</p></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p3\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t3\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"lim\">⚠️ 局限/说明：方差大、需要很多样本；最早系统提出的是 Williams 1992 的 REINFORCE。</p></div>"}}
